As a premier aristocratic clan of Xu Province, they were praised alongside the Yuan clan as 'scions of noble blood.' Chen Deng served as General Who Calms the Waves and repeatedly defeated Sun Ce, earning Liu Bei's praise that 'for his civil and military prowess, courage, and vision, one must look to the ancients.'"},"talent":{"military":"6","commerce":"5","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[{"story":"S10802","members":["WJ10068","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10323"]},{"story":"S10615","members":["WJ10068","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10323"]},{"story":"S10402","members":["WJ10068","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10323"]},{"story":"S10415","members":["WJ10068","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10323"]},{"story":"S10202","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10183","WJ10257","WJ10323","WJ10577","WJ10012","WJ10013"]},{"story":"S10715","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10183","WJ10257","WJ10323","WJ10577","WJ10012","WJ10013"]},{"story":"S10102","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10183","WJ10257","WJ10323","WJ10577","WJ10012","WJ10013"]},{"story":"S10315","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10183","WJ10257","WJ10323","WJ10012","WJ10013","WJ10017","WJ10111","WJ10014","WJ10018"]},{"story":"S10302","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10183","WJ10257","WJ10323","WJ10012","WJ10013","WJ10017","WJ10111","WJ10014","WJ10018"]},{"story":"S10602","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10183","WJ10257","WJ10323","WJ10012","WJ10013","WJ10017","WJ10111","WJ10014","WJ10018","WJ10370","WJ10117"]},{"story":"S10502","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ10183","WJ10257","WJ10323","WJ10012","WJ10013","WJ10017","WJ10111","WJ10014","WJ10018","WJ10370"]},{"story":"S10815","members":["WJ10011","WJ10138","WJ10352","WJ10133","WJ1014802","WJ10165","WJ