quipment":{"weapon":"WP28001","armor":"WP1016205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[28,12,80,75,76,40],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"17100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP28001","armor":"WP1016205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10068","city":"CS1020","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[28,12,80,75,76,40],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"17100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP28001","armor":"WP1016205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"陈登之父，曾任沛相，刘备接任徐州时跟随了刘备。后徐州被吕布所占，屈于其下。袁术称帝，前来攻打吕布时，献计使得其手下韩暹、杨奉二人倒戈，因此让吕布连连得胜。赢取吕布信任后奉命独守徐州，陈珪趁机将徐州献曹操，使吕布最终在下邳败亡。","tc":"陳登之父，曾任沛相，劉備接任徐州時跟隨了劉備。后徐州被呂布所占，屈于其下。袁術稱帝，前來攻打呂布時，獻計使得其手下韓暹、楊奉二人倒戈，因此讓呂布連連得勝。贏取呂布信任后奉命獨守徐州，陳珪趁機將徐州獻曹操，使呂布最終在下邳敗亡。","en":"Father of Chen Deng, he once served as Chancellor of Pei. When Liu Bei took over Xu Province, Chen Gui followed him. After Lu Bu seized Xu Province, Chen Gui was forced to serve under him. When Yuan Shu declared himself emperor and attacked Lu Bu, Chen Gui devised a stratagem that turned Yuan Shu's subordinates Han Xian and Yang Feng against their master, enabling Lu Bu to win consecutive victories. After earning Lu Bu's trust, he was entrusted with the sole defense of Xu Province. Chen Gui used this opportunity to hand Xu Province over to Cao Cao, which ultimately led to Lu Bu's defeat and death at Xiapi.","jp":"陳登の父。かつて沛相を務め、劉備が徐州を継ぐとこれに従った。その後、徐州が呂布に奪われると、その軍門に降った。袁術が皇帝即位し呂布を攻め寄せた際、計を授けて袁術配下の韓暹と楊奉を寝返らせ、呂布を連戦連勝へと導いた。呂布の信任を得て徐州の留守を任されると、機に乗じて徐州を曹操に献上し、最終的に呂布を下邳にて敗亡へと追いやった。","kr":"진등의 아버지. 일찍이 패상을 지냈으며, 유비가 서주를 이어받았을 때 유비를 섬겼다. 이후 여포가 서주를 점령하자 그의 휘하에 들어갔다. 원술이 칭제하고 여포를 공격해 오자 계책을 올려 적장 한섬과 양봉을 돌아서게 만들었고, 이로써 여포가 연전연승을 거두게 했다. 여포의 신임을 얻은 뒤 홀로 서주를 지키라는 명을 받자, 틈을 타 서주를 조조에게 바쳐 여포가 결국 하비에서 패망하도록 만들었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10322","remark":"","surname":"陈","surnameTc":"陳","surnameEn":"Chen","surnameJp":"陳","surnameKr":"진","surnameOther":"","name":"珪","nameTc":"珪","nameEn":"Gui","nameJp":"珪","nameKr":"규","nameOther":"","word":"汉瑜","wordTc":"漢瑜","wordEn":"Hanyu","wordJp":"漢瑜","wordKr":"한유","wordOther":"","icon":"陈珪","power":"WJ10068","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1018","gender":"0","rule":"28","force":"12","wise":"80","politics":"75","charm":"76","will":"40","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"4/4/4/4/4/80/44/4","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1005105;16","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1019605","debateSoul":"1006005","warSoulPoint":"700","battleSoulPoint":"100","debateSoulPoint":"6400","strategy":"1004408","strategy2":"1009601;1001115","professions":"0/0/0/0/1/0/0/2/1/2/0/0/0/1/0/5/3/4/3/1/0/0/0/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"52","loyalty":"100","reputation":"17100","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"5","birth":"132","show":"184","death":"206","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP28001","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;15/1;21/1;29/1;31/1;39/1;58/1;42/0;27/0;13/1;67/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"WJ10323/100","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10064/7","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"陈登之父，曾任沛相，刘备接任徐州时跟随了刘备。后徐州被吕布所占，屈于其下。袁术称帝，前来攻打吕布时，献计使得其手下韩暹、杨奉二人倒戈，因此让吕布连连得胜。赢取吕